        "description": "<p>Send scheduled email reports of Contact Form 7 submissions in CSV attachments.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Schedule emails on a daily, weekly, or monthly basis.  </li>\n<li>Select all form submissions from the last 7, 30, or 90 days.</li>\n<li>Set the email recipients.</li>\n</ul>\n",
